        "description": "<p>Allows users in admin settings to select one or more terms in a taxonomy.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports all hierarchical taxonomies</li>\n<li>Allows selection of one or more different terms</li>\n<li>You can select 1 parent term and 1 child term or 1 parent term and multiple child terms.</li>\n</ul>\n",
